nity.com/id/Ropi_Jr/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 106, "playtime_forever": 1142, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1142, "last_played": 1750008983, "avatar": "b04bbb08b93a950cf3de305e65c8705674e602fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeah nah. This one’s just trash.\r\n\r\nAlien Swarm feels like a tech demo that overstayed its welcome. Clunky movement, boring missions, zero atmosphere — and whatever tension it tries to build dies fast.\r\n\r\nTop-down shooting can work.\r\nHere? It doesn’t.\r\n\r\nCo-op doesn’t save it, progression feels pointless, and after a short time you’re just going through the motions. No hook, no vibe, no reason to keep playing.\r\n\r\nFree or not — time is still worth something.\r\n\r\n✅ It’s free\r\n❌ Boring and repetitive\r\n❌ Clunky controls\r\n❌ Zero staying power\r\n\r\nFinal verdict:\r\n3/10 – Free doesn’t mean fun.", "timestamp_created": 1767900881, "timestamp_updated": 1767900881, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.355093330144882202", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215406484", "author": {"steamid": "76561198968620815", "personaname": "Squidgy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/squidgychurch/", "num_games_owned": 95, "num_reviews": 99, "playtime_forever": 55, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 55, "last_played": 1728410363, "avatar": "0f420c4de9ed84dbee49e200d3a21ececfe314d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "foids beware you're in for a scare", "timestamp_created": 1767798494, "timestamp_updated": 1767798494, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.438348293304443359", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "writ